Z||000009||Ferrari_cdn||07-16-2001||04:53 AM||||Yeah!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Say, the owner of my soon to be Fiero says that it doesn't have a block heater.  I'm sure you know we would need them in case of bitter cold times  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  How much would they be?  My dad told me he guesses about $100.<BR>Is that correct?||||reg||7
